{"version":1,"key":"card:477","content":{"id":477,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d66f47ef-a3a6-4736-b34d-fa3c53acff83","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 让你能够访问与 Python 解释器紧密相关的变量和函数"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_f26b3b12-177c-438a-b6af-e979b0dcb354.png","pasteUploading":false,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c5030684-34fb-413c-8cef-349937f5f7e5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1c4b5db6-176f-436b-9fc5-719a91025eec","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d7b2749b-4245-483b-a479-0c16f4a635bf","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5f282b90-5076-4e28-bfdd-0593a5f770bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.argv"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 包含传递给 Python 解释器的参数，其中包括脚本名"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5a271038-af87-46db-8030-d4d66036fca4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"35af3a4d-2eea-47b9-8cc8-c7586d98324b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"函数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.exit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 退出当前程序。你可向它提供一个整数，指出程序是否成功，这是一种 UNIX 约定。在大多数情况下，使用该参数的默认值（0，表示成功）即可。也可向它提供一个字符串，这个字符串将成为错误消息，对用户找出程序终止的原因很有帮助。在这种情况下，程序退出时将显示指定的错误消息以及一个表示失败的编码"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5e724d0b-d3ef-45cd-9627-737138281932","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"56abc2fd-73a6-4ee2-8aa4-58456e762020","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"映射 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.modules"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 将模块名映射到模块（仅限于当前已导入的模块）"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"211fec88-7eb6-4c23-96cb-c284668fe0e8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cc684cc6-f47a-4f29-960b-b0072c712797","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.path"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是一个字符串列表，其中的每个字符串都是一个目录名，执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"import"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语句时将在这些目录中查找模块"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"47dab2e9-78f1-442b-ae9e-6b2180db62d2","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac0246ec-0e04-4bc7-a3a4-acdd588a3112","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.platform"},{"type":"formatted","text":"（一个字符串）是运行解释器的“平台”名称"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"988f9f69-7e9e-4856-9f29-2ae017eb279c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c8b6c4d-e5b6-406c-b687-a84a0355b2be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"变量 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.stdin"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.stdout"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.stderr"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是类似于文件的流对象，表示标准的UNIX概念：标准输入、标准输出和标准错误。简单地说，Python 从 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.stdin"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取输入（例如，用于 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"input"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中），并将输出打印到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"sys.stdout"}]}]}]}],"tags":["Python/标准库/sys"],"createTime":1719398405066,"updateTime":1743303640442,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640442}}